sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant p0 as Sender
    participant p1 as Gateway
    participant p2 as Message Store
    participant p3 as Delivery Stream
    participant p4 as Receiver
    participant p5 as Push Provider
    p0->>p1: Send client message id
    p1->>p2: Append with dedup key
    p2->>p1: Ack and sequence offset
    p1->>p0: Accepted with message id
    p1->>p3: Publish committed message
    p3->>p4: Push if connected
    p3->>p5: Notify offline device
    p4->>p1: Reconnect with last offset
    p1->>p2: Replay missing messages
